<div class="section_content content" id="33429910_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">The zoning districts listed in § <a class="xref" guid="33429911" href="33429911#33429911">375-202</a>, Summary Table of Zoning Districts, are hereby created. These districts shall have the boundaries shown on the official Zoning Map maintained by the Chief Planning Official and available on the City of Albany's website.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
